fffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2014학년도 1학기 복수전공 및 부전공 이수 포기(변경)에 관한 사항을</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">아래와 같이 안내하오니 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#3d0099\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 신청 기간 : 2014.05.21.(수)~05.26.(월)</span></font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#3d0099\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 신청 장소</span></strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 가. 복수전공 및 부전공 해당 “종합학사행정실”</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유(날인)한 후</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">복수전공(변경)/부전공 학부장에게 제출</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#3d0099\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 신청 서류 : 포기(변경)신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부.</span></strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 이수 성적이 평점평균 3.00이상 이어야 합니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 나. 복수전공 및 부전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며, </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공학점으로 인정합니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. <font color=\"#993800\">졸업 대상자 중에서 복수전공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 되었으나, </font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#993800\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 합니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 2011학년도 이후 수강한 복수전공 및 부전공 이수구분은 포기(변경)에 따라 자동변경됩니다. </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010학년도 이전에 수강한 과목은 이수구분 변경기간에 변경신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2014. 05. </span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">교 무 처 장</span></span></span><br></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
